OL,3,GNEWSAChurch could get first toilet in
OL,4,Amore than 700 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medieval church is a step closer to
OL,7,Fgetting its first ever toilet, so
OL,8,Fvisitors will no longer have to walk
OL,9,F100m (328 ft) down steep stone steps to
OL,10,Fuse a loo in the village.
OL,12,FSt Giles Church in Hartington,
OL,13,FDerbyshire, which is more than 700
OL,14,Fyears old, is raising #140,000 for a
OL,15,Fproject which will give them a full
OL,16,Fwater supply for the first time, and
OL,17,Fthey plan to install an accessible
OL,18,Ftoilet and kitchen servery area.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
