OL,3,GNEWSAChurch could get first toilet in
OL,4,Amore than 700 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have been awarded two grants
OL,7,Ftotaling #20,000, and with previous
OL,8,Ffundraising they have #30,000 left to
OL,9,Fraise, the National Churches Trust
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FCanon Nicola McNally said the toilets
OL,13,F"will make a real difference to the
OL,14,Fwelcome and comfort we can extend to
OL,15,Fpeople".
